WEBVTT

00:13.490 --> 00:15.491
Hi. Hi.

00:42.203 --> 00:46.488
The walls are cold, the air is thin. The noise

00:46.628 --> 00:51.694
outside is closing in. I'm running from the face

00:51.974 --> 00:57.200
I see. The victims say they made of me. This rage

00:57.360 --> 01:02.126
is just a heavy stone, a gravity.

01:03.744 --> 01:08.549
Shedding skin, shedding weight Escaping from

01:08.589 --> 01:15.275
this world of rage

01:21.596 --> 01:25.417
I see a light in the endless black A signal

01:25.497 --> 01:29.479
calling, no turning back The pull of the old

01:29.539 --> 01:35.481
world fades away A new horizon, a new day I'm

01:35.521 --> 01:41.383
climbing, climbing Past the point of no return

01:41.403 --> 01:48.785
I'm flying, flying With the fire I let burn Just a

01:48.845 --> 01:53.367
signal, a distant light Burning through the

01:53.447 --> 01:56.850
endless night

01:57.330 --> 01:57.630
Astro

02:21.335 --> 02:25.857
I'm floating now, the engine's off The silence

02:26.257 --> 02:31.719
is a holy sound The rage is gone, the fear is lost

02:31.839 --> 02:37.062
in this new universe I found I'm loved by the sun,

02:37.382 --> 02:43.484
I'm held by the void An orbit just begun A life not

02:43.524 --> 02:47.326
destroyed and the stars are singing a song I

02:47.566 --> 02:56.438
understand I'm finally, finally reaching for

02:57.139 --> 02:59.122
your hand

03:58.208 --> 03:58.329
♪

04:07.834 --> 04:11.396
The walls are gone ♪ ♪

04:14.998 --> 04:24.183
The air is clear ♪ ♪ There is no noise ♪

04:27.905 --> 04:30.466
There is no fear Heart is strong Heart is strong

04:30.606 --> 04:31.006
Heart is strong

04:57.310 --> 04:58.095
Yeah.

